bot-avatar
==========

This crate is a Rust port of the open-bot-avatar rendering engine
(https://github.com/DominikScholz/open-bot-avatar, commit e10afe4), and embeds its
example and gallery avatar definitions (gallery/*.json) and a verbatim copy of the
TypeScript engine source (upstream/src) used as the reference for the golden tests.

